WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:17.916
at what you've done!"

2
00:00:18.357 --> 00:00:20.057
the president shouted at Barry.

3
00:00:20.858 --> 00:00:21.558
"I'm sorry!"

4
00:00:22.019 --> 00:00:22.559
Barry said.

5
00:00:22.579 --> 00:00:24.920
"I just wanted to make you proud, Dad."

6
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.622
"Dad?" Ally thought.

7
00:00:27.642 --> 00:00:31.544
"No wonder Barry has been trying to learn all about me!

8
00:00:32.052 --> 00:00:34.313
He's been spying on me for his father!"

9
00:00:35.054 --> 00:00:35.794
Barry gulped.

10
00:00:35.814 --> 00:00:42.518
"You see, Dad Ally is—" "Just a regular human, like you!"

11
00:00:42.898 --> 00:00:43.599
Ally shouted.

12
00:00:44.879 --> 00:00:48.822
The guests broke into laughter, wondering if this whole scene was a show.

13
00:00:50.262 --> 00:00:52.584
But the president was still glaring at Barry.

14
00:00:57.206 --> 00:00:59.888
Ally smiled meekly and slunk away to the restroom.

15
00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:05.878
"Alpha would know what to do," she thought.

16
00:01:06.418 --> 00:01:08.500
Suddenly someone flung open the door.

17
00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.102
"Oh good!

18
00:01:11.122 --> 00:01:13.323
I found you, Ally," Bethany said.

19
00:01:13.343 --> 00:01:16.405
"I have to tell you something."

20
00:01:17.726 --> 00:01:18.227
She flushed.

21
00:01:18.247 --> 00:01:24.891
"It sounds silly, but I was getting jealous of all the time you and Mateo spend together.

22
00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:34.022
So I'm sorry if I acted weird before."

23
00:01:34.042 --> 00:01:39.125
"Jealous?" Ally faked a laugh.

24
00:01:39.145 --> 00:01:41.747
"We're just friends, Bethany.

25
00:01:42.228 --> 00:01:43.689
He really likes you."

26
00:01:43.709 --> 00:01:45.830
"I know that now.

27
00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.912
And thank you for helping him to plan my surprise.

28
00:01:49.553 --> 00:01:52.054
Want to see all the gifts from the scavenger hunt?"

29
00:01:53.435 --> 00:01:57.819
Bethany showed her an action figure, trading cards, socks with stars, and a T-shirt.

30
00:01:57.839 --> 00:01:59.300
"And this."

31
00:01:59.992 --> 00:02:01.593
Bethany pulled out a small device.

32
00:02:02.073 --> 00:02:03.754
Ally gasped.

33
00:02:04.394 --> 00:02:05.054
It was Alpha!

34
00:02:05.074 --> 00:02:08.696
"Where did you find her, I mean, that?"

35
00:02:09.216 --> 00:02:09.797
Ally asked.

36
00:02:09.817 --> 00:02:15.119
"Here." Bethany pointed to the top of the paper towel dispenser.

37
00:02:15.139 --> 00:02:18.120
"Don't tell Mateo, but it's broken.

38
00:02:19.001 --> 00:02:22.983
It makes such terrible noises, I had to turn it off."

39
00:02:24.383 --> 00:02:25.904
Ally couldn't believe her luck.

40
00:02:28.304 --> 00:02:29.805
"I can try to fix it for you."

41
00:02:29.825 --> 00:02:32.266
"Thanks, that would be great!"

42
00:02:34.267 --> 00:02:35.808
Bethany handed Alpha to Ally.

43
00:02:37.549 --> 00:02:40.291
As soon as Bethany left, Ally turned Alpha back on.

44
00:02:40.311 --> 00:02:44.173
"I'm so happy you're back!"

45
00:02:44.193 --> 00:02:49.536
"That is a valid emotion," Alpha said as someone knocked on the restroom door.

46
00:02:49.556 --> 00:02:51.797
"Ally?" It was Barry.

47
00:02:51.817 --> 00:02:53.378
"Can you come out here?"

48
00:02:55.599 --> 00:02:56.980
Ally slumped against the door.

49
00:02:58.088 --> 00:03:00.430
"I can't go out there, Alpha," she said.

50
00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:04.792
"What if his VIP father knows I'm from Astralia?

51
00:03:05.353 --> 00:03:07.494
He'll tell everyone, and then Dr.

52
00:03:07.534 --> 00:03:12.477
Lloyd will find me, and "Irrational thought," Alpha said.

53
00:03:12.497 --> 00:03:15.719
"If Barry's father knew, he wouldn't send Barry to get you."

54
00:03:15.739 --> 00:03:18.781
"You're right."

55
00:03:20.182 --> 00:03:22.584
Ally blew out a breath and stepped into the hallway.

56
00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.082
"I messed everything up," Barry said.

57
00:03:29.102 --> 00:03:33.366
"I've been trying to get Dad to visit the diner since I started working here.

58
00:03:34.227 --> 00:03:36.609
I couldn't believe he agreed to come to the gala."

59
00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.232
"Why did you want him to come so badly?"

60
00:03:40.692 --> 00:03:41.273
Ally asked.

61
00:03:41.293 --> 00:03:44.476
"I've always dreamed of owning a restaurant someday.

62
00:03:45.837 --> 00:03:48.339
But Dad wants me to have a career in science.

63
00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:53.544
When I read Greta's review, I knew this was the perfect place to learn about food.

64
00:03:57.024 --> 00:04:00.327
And I thought if my father could see the diner and how good I am at my job,

65
00:04:00.607 --> 00:04:01.688
he'd finally approve."

66
00:04:02.989 --> 00:04:03.630
Ally blinked.

67
00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:07.373
"Barry's not spying on me," she realized.

68
00:04:07.393 --> 00:04:12.798
"He's just trying to please his father—something that I can totally relate to!"

69
00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.141
She patted Barry's arm.

70
00:04:17.161 --> 00:04:20.224
"You're a good waiter.

71
00:04:20.244 --> 00:04:24.548
I bet one day your father will understand how much it means to you."

72
00:04:32.142 --> 00:04:36.244
Later Ally and Mateo were in his living room listening to music playing from an old phone.

73
00:04:36.264 --> 00:04:44.128
"I'm so happy you found this old phone in the Earth sculpture, Mateo," Ally said.

74
00:04:44.148 --> 00:04:47.129
"It's the perfect home for Alpha!"

75
00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:53.972
"Now I just need to find a new home for myself," she thought.

76
00:04:55.196 --> 00:04:58.557
"Soon we can try to make a distress signal," Mateo said.

77
00:04:59.177 --> 00:05:01.918
Before Ally could reply, Ray entered, holding a letter.

78
00:05:03.539 --> 00:05:04.459
He didn't look happy.

79
00:05:04.479 --> 00:05:08.040
"Mateo, this is from your mother," Ray said.

80
00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:09.880
"She's coming to town next week."

81
00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:13.101
"Is she coming back to stay?"

82
00:05:13.481 --> 00:05:14.222
Mateo asked.

83
00:05:14.982 --> 00:05:16.902
Ray shrugged and ran a hand through his hair.

84
00:05:17.983 --> 00:05:19.623
Ally quickly read Ray's thoughts.

85
00:05:20.444 --> 00:05:21.684
He was thinking about Flo!

86
00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.841
Was Ray getting used to the idea of a divorce?

87
00:05:25.861 --> 00:05:27.662
"You know what?"

88
00:05:28.323 --> 00:05:30.044
Ray shoved the letter in his back pocket.

89
00:05:30.064 --> 00:05:32.125
"Let's not think about that right now.

90
00:05:33.946 --> 00:05:36.607
Ally, I love how lively this house is with you in it.

91
00:05:37.128 --> 00:05:38.749
I hope you'll stay as long as you like."

92
00:05:38.769 --> 00:05:42.070
"You mean that?"

93
00:05:42.571 --> 00:05:43.031
Ally said.

94
00:05:43.051 --> 00:05:46.913
"You're not annoyed by all my um, noise?"

95
00:05:46.933 --> 00:05:51.656
"Of course not," Ray said.

96
00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.382
"Thank you—that makes me very happy!"

97
00:05:55.842 --> 00:05:56.342
Ally said.

98
00:05:56.362 --> 00:05:57.723
"Me too.

99
00:05:58.184 --> 00:05:59.204
Now turn the music up."

100
00:05:59.885 --> 00:06:00.585
Ray grinned.

101
00:06:01.125 --> 00:06:01.926
"Let's dance!"

102
00:06:05.048 --> 00:06:08.190
As Ally danced with her friends, she couldn't help but smile too.

103
00:06:09.251 --> 00:06:11.992
"I haven't found a way home yet," she thought.

104
00:06:12.012 --> 00:06:17.336
"But like Alpha said, thinking about the positives makes everything better!"
